{
  "title": "Limits5.1",
  "notes": [
    "<h2>Limits and Continuity — Exercise 15.1</h2>",

    "<h3>Question 1: Find the following limits</h3>",

    "<h4>a) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 2} (2x^2 + 3x - 14)$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "$$= 2 \\cdot 2^2 + 3 \\cdot 2 - 14$$",
    "$$= 8 + 6 - 14$$",
    "$$= 0$$",

    "<h4>b) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 5} (x^2 + 2x - 9)$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "$$= 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5 - 9$$",
    "$$= 25 + 10 - 9$$",
    "$$= 26$$",

    "<h4>c) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{3x^2 + 2x - 4}{x^2 + 5x - 4}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "$$= \\frac{3 \\cdot 1^2 + 2 \\cdot 1 - 4}{1^2 + 5 \\cdot 1 - 4}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1}{2}$$",

    "<h4>d) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 3} \\frac{6x^2 + 3x - 12}{2x^2 + x + 1}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "$$= \\frac{6 \\cdot 3^2 + 3 \\cdot 3 - 12}{2 \\cdot 3^2 + 3 + 1}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{51}{22}$$",

    "<h3>Question 2: Compute the following limits</h3>",

    "<h4>a) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{4x^3 - x^2 + 2x}{3x^2 + 4x}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "<p>Factoring $x$ from numerator and denominator:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{x(4x^2 - x + 2)}{x(3x + 4)}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{4 \\cdot 0^2 - 0 + 2}{3 \\cdot 0 + 4}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1}{2}$$",

    "<h4>b) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 4} \\frac{x^3 - 64}{x^2 - 16}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "<p>Factoring using $a^3-b^3$ and $a^2-b^2$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 4} \\frac{(x-4)(x^2 + 4x + 16)}{(x+4)(x-4)}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{4^2 + 4 \\cdot 4 + 16}{4 + 4}$$",
    "$$= 6$$",

    "<h4>c) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{x^{2/3} - a^{2/3}}{x - a}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "<p>Writing as difference of squares in terms of $x^{1/3}$ and $a^{1/3}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{(x^{1/3})^2 - (a^{1/3})^2}{(x^{1/3})^3 - (a^{1/3})^3}$$",
    "<p>Factoring numerator and denominator:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{(x^{1/3} - a^{1/3})(x^{1/3} + a^{1/3})}{(x^{1/3} - a^{1/3})(x^{2/3} + x^{1/3}a^{1/3} + a^{2/3})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{x^{1/3} + a^{1/3}}{x^{2/3} + x^{1/3}a^{1/3} + a^{2/3}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{a^{1/3} + a^{1/3}}{a^{2/3} + a^{2/3} + a^{2/3}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2a^{1/3}}{3a^{2/3}} = \\frac{2}{3} a^{-1/3}$$",

    "<h4>d) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{x^2 + 3x - 4}{x - 1}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{(x+4)(x-1)}{(x-1)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} (x + 4)$$",
    "$$= 1 + 4 = 5$$",

    "<h4>e) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x^2 - 5x + 6}{x^2 - x - 2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{(x-3)(x-2)}{(x+1)(x-2)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x-3}{x+1}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2-3}{2+1} = -\\frac{1}{3}$$",

    "<h4>f) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x^2 - 4x + 4}{x^2 - 7x + 10}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{(x-2)(x-2)}{(x-2)(x-5)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x-2}{x-5}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2-2}{2-5} = 0$$",

    "<h4>g) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{\\sqrt{3x} - \\sqrt{2x+a}}{2(x-a)}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "<p>Multiplying numerator and denominator by the conjugate $\\sqrt{3x} + \\sqrt{2x+a}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{3x - 2x - a}{2(x-a)(\\sqrt{3x} + \\sqrt{2x+a})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{x-a}{2(x-a)(\\sqrt{3x} + \\sqrt{2x+a})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{1}{2(\\sqrt{3x} + \\sqrt{2x+a})}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1}{2(\\sqrt{3a} + \\sqrt{3a})} = \\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{3a}}$$",

    "<h4>h) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{\\sqrt{2x} - \\sqrt{3x-a}}{\\sqrt{x} - \\sqrt{a}}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "<p>Multiplying numerator by $\\sqrt{2x}+\\sqrt{3x-a}$ and denominator by $\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{a}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{(2x) - (3x-a)}{(x-a)} \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{2x} + \\sqrt{3x-a}}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{(2x - 3x + a)(\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{a})}{(x-a)(\\sqrt{2x} + \\sqrt{3x-a})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{-(x-a)(\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{a})}{(x-a)(\\sqrt{2x} + \\sqrt{3x-a})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{-(\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{a})}{\\sqrt{2x} + \\sqrt{3x-a}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{-2\\sqrt{a}}{2\\sqrt{2a}} = -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$$",

    "<h4>i) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{\\sqrt{2x} - \\sqrt{3-x^2}}{x-1}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "<p>Multiplying numerator and denominator by $\\sqrt{2x} + \\sqrt{3-x^2}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{(2x) - (3-x^2)}{(x-1)(\\sqrt{2x} + \\sqrt{3-x^2})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{x^2 + 2x - 3}{(x-1)(\\sqrt{2x} + \\sqrt{3-x^2})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{(x+3)(x-1)}{(x-1)(\\sqrt{2x} + \\sqrt{3-x^2})}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1+3}{\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{2}} = \\sqrt{2}$$",

    "<h4>j) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{\\sqrt{x} - \\sqrt{6-x^2}}{x-2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "<p>Multiplying numerator and denominator by $\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{6-x^2}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x - 6 + x^2}{(x-2)(\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{6-x^2})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{(x-2)(x+3)}{(x-2)(\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{6-x^2})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x+3}{\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{6-x^2}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2+3}{\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{2}}$$",

    "<h4>k) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 64} \\frac{\\sqrt[6]{x} - 2}{\\sqrt[3]{x} - 4}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 64} \\frac{x^{1/6} - 2}{(\\sqrt[6]{x})^2 - 2^2}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 64} \\frac{\\sqrt[6]{x} - 2}{(\\sqrt[6]{x} - 2)(\\sqrt[6]{x} + 2)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 64} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[6]{x} + 2}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[6]{64} + 2} = \\frac{1}{4}$$",

    "<h4>l) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{\\sqrt{3a-x} - \\sqrt{x+a}}{4(x-a)}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b></p>",
    "<p>Multiplying numerator and denominator by $\\sqrt{3a-x} + \\sqrt{x+a}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{(3a-x) - (x+a)}{4(x-a)(\\sqrt{3a-x} + \\sqrt{x+a})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{-2(x-a)}{4(x-a)(\\sqrt{3a-x} + \\sqrt{x+a})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{-1}{2(\\sqrt{3a-x} + \\sqrt{x+a})}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{-1}{2(\\sqrt{2a} + \\sqrt{2a})} = -\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{2a}}$$",

    "<h3>Question 3: Calculate the following limits</h3>",

    "<h4>a) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{2x^2}{3x^2 + 2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Dividing numerator and denominator by $x^2$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{2}{3 + \\frac{2}{x^2}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2}{3+0} = \\frac{2}{3}$$",

    "<h4>b) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{3x^2 - 4}{4x^2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Dividing numerator and denominator by $x^2$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\left( \\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{1}{x^2} \\right)$$",
    "$$= \\frac{3}{4} - 0 = \\frac{3}{4}$$",

    "<h4>c) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{4x^2 + 3x + 2}{5x^2 + 4x - 3}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Dividing numerator and denominator by $x^2$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{4 + \\frac{3}{x} + \\frac{2}{x^2}}{5 + \\frac{4}{x} - \\frac{3}{x^2}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{4}{5}$$",

    "<h4>d) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{5x^2 + 2x - 7}{3x^2 + 5x + 2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Dividing numerator and denominator by $x^2$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{5 + \\frac{2}{x} - \\frac{7}{x^2}}{3 + \\frac{5}{x} + \\frac{2}{x^2}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{5}{3}$$",

    "<h3>Question 4: Calculate the following limits</h3>",

    "<h4>a) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} (\\sqrt{x} - \\sqrt{x-3})$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by the conjugate $\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{x-3}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{x - (x-3)}{\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{x-3}}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{x-3}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{3}{\\infty + \\infty} = 0$$",

    "<h4>b) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} (\\sqrt{x-a} - \\sqrt{x-b})$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by the conjugate $\\sqrt{x-a} + \\sqrt{x-b}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{(x-a) - (x-b)}{\\sqrt{x-a} + \\sqrt{x-b}}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{b-a}{\\sqrt{x-a} + \\sqrt{x-b}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{b-a}{\\infty + \\infty} = 0$$",

    "<h4>c) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} (\\sqrt{3x} - \\sqrt{x-5})$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by the conjugate $\\sqrt{3x} + \\sqrt{x-5}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{3x - (x-5)}{\\sqrt{3x} + \\sqrt{x-5}}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{2x+5}{\\sqrt{3x} + \\sqrt{x-5}}$$",
    "<p>Dividing numerator and denominator by $x$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{2 + \\frac{5}{x}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{x}} + \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{x} - \\frac{5}{x^2}}}$$",
    "$$= \\infty$$",

    "<h4>d) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\sqrt{x}(\\sqrt{x} - \\sqrt{x-a})$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by the conjugate $\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{x-a}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{\\sqrt{x}(x - (x-a))}{\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{x-a}}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{a\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{x-a}}$$",
    "<p>Dividing numerator and denominator by $\\sqrt{x}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{a}{1 + \\sqrt{1 - \\frac{a}{x}}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{a}{1+\\sqrt{1}} = \\frac{a}{2}$$",

    "<h4>e) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} (\\sqrt{x-a} - \\sqrt{bx})$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by the conjugate $\\sqrt{x-a} + \\sqrt{bx}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{(x-a) - bx}{\\sqrt{x-a} + \\sqrt{bx}}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{x(1-b) - a}{\\sqrt{x-a} + \\sqrt{bx}}$$",
    "<p>Dividing numerator and denominator by $x$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{(1-b) - \\frac{a}{x}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{x} - \\frac{a}{x^2}} + \\sqrt{\\frac{b}{x}}} = \\infty \\ \\text{if } b \\ne 1$$",
    "<p>If $b = 1$, then:</p>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\frac{(1-b)(x-a)}{\\sqrt{x-a} + \\sqrt{bx}} = \\frac{-a}{\\infty + \\infty} = 0$$",

    "<h3>Question 5: Evaluate the following limits</h3>",

    "<h4>a) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x - \\sqrt{8-x^2}}{\\sqrt{x^2+12} - 4}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying by conjugates $(x+\\sqrt{8-x^2})$ and $(\\sqrt{x^2+12}+4)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{(x^2 - 8 + x^2)(\\sqrt{x^2+12} + 4)}{(x^2+12-16)(x + \\sqrt{8-x^2})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{2(x^2-4)(\\sqrt{x^2+12} + 4)}{(x^2-4)(x + \\sqrt{8-x^2})}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{2(\\sqrt{x^2+12} + 4)}{x + \\sqrt{8-x^2}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2(\\sqrt{4+12} + 4)}{2 + \\sqrt{8-4}} = 4$$",

    "<h4>b) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{x - \\sqrt{2-x^2}}{2x - \\sqrt{2+2x^2}}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying by conjugates $(x+\\sqrt{2-x^2})$ and $(2x+\\sqrt{2+2x^2})$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{(x^2 - 2 + x^2)}{(4x^2 - 2 - 2x^2)} \\cdot \\frac{2x + \\sqrt{2+2x^2}}{x + \\sqrt{2-x^2}}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{(2x^2-2)}{(2x^2-2)} \\cdot \\frac{2x + \\sqrt{2+2x^2}}{x + \\sqrt{2-x^2}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2\\cdot1 + \\sqrt{2+2\\cdot1}}{1 + \\sqrt{2-1^2}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2+2}{1+1} = 2$$"
  ]
}